e right of the 'call now' and 'draft text' buttons in the educator profile view.  as it stands, when i click it, it appears to do nothing\n9. implement your recommendation to make the button's actions clearer please.  i already tapped if for one lead...is there a way to correct/reverse it?\n10. Check and ensure the DNC functionality is working properly.  i clicked it, got the confirrmation and confirmed, but there is nothing in the lead card that indicates it's DNC...nor did an emerald 'reinstate' button appear\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n# Continuation Summary\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n- **Verify and Finish DNC Flag & Reinstatement Real-Time UI Feedback:**\n  - *User Directive:* `\"Check and ensure the DNC functionality is working properly. i clicked it, got the confirrmation and confirmed, but there is nothing in the lead card that indicates it's DNC...nor did an emerald 'reinstate' button appear\"`\n  - *Status:* **IMPLEMENTATION** (Optimistic state update `setLead((prev) => ({ ...prev, last_disposition: 'do_not_call' }))` and `{ ...l }` cloning were implemented; remaining: add high-contrast red DNC banner card in `LeadDetailScreen.tsx`, compile web bundle, deploy to Surge, and verify live).\n- **Auto-Deploy to Surge Rule (Standing Directive):**\n  - *User Directive:* `\"deploy it to surge please...and do so going forward after every new compile\"`\n  - *Status:* **IMPLEMENTATION** (Auto-deploy to `https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh` after every build).\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n- **User Directives & Feedback:**\n  - `\"the SnapDialer title in the header bar of the app is printing the 'r' on a second line when viewing the app on my iphone 14 in standard screen (not landscape mode)...\"` — Fixed with `numberOfLines={1}`, `flexShrink: 0`, and rebalanced header icon gap and button sizes.\n  - `\"I notice that when looking at the Educator Profile edit screen, there is no ability to change or add an email. please address that.\"` — Implemented email field in Edit form, `Mail` icon, 1-tap `mailto:` in View mode, and database persistence.\n  - `\"do not change the codebase, but tell me that the red shield icon with the exclaimation point in the center does...\"` — Explained DNC compliance role and why `Alert.alert` was silent on Web PWA.\n  - `\"implement your recommendation to make the button's actions clearer please. i already tapped if for one lead...is there a way to correct/reverse it?\"` — Added confirmation modal, `🔄 Reinstate` button, and visual toast feedback.\n  - `\"Check and ensure the DNC functionality is working properly. i clicked it, got the confirrmation and confirmed, but there is nothing in the lead card that indicates it's DNC...nor did an emerald 'reinstate' button appear\"` — Root-caused state reference equality and database parameter index shift.\n- **Target Company & Production URL:**\n  - ValuTeachers Florida FRS Dialing System.\n  - Live Surge Domain: `https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n1. **Header Layout Alignment on iPhone 14 Portrait (`src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx`):**\n   - Locked `SnapDialer` title onto a single line (`numberOfLines={1}`, `flexShrink: 0`, `fontSize: 21`, `fontWeight: '900'`).\n   - Compacted `snapHeaderButton` and `headerIcons` to ensure ample width on 375px–390px mobile screens.\n2. **Educator Email Address Editing & Display (`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`):**\n   - Added Email input field in Edit Form.\n   - Added Email row with `Mail` icon and 1-tap `mailto:` in View Mode.\n   - Updated `UPDATE leads` query and `WebDatabase` parameter mapping to persist email.\n3. **DNC (Do Not Call) Compliance & 1-Tap Reinstatement Engine:**\n   - Transformed Red Shield button into a dynamic toggle: `🛡️ DNC` on active leads vs `🔄 Reinstate` on DNC leads.\n   - Added web/mobile confirmation dialogs and persistent toast banners (`showToast`).\n   - Added optimistic UI state updates (`setLead((prev) => ({ ...prev, last_disposition: 'do_not_call' }))`) and object cloning (`{ ...l }`) so React immediately re-renders the badge and action button without waiting for async I/O.\n4. **Database Parameter Mapping Fix (`src/db/database.ts`, `src/db/leadsRepository.ts`):**\n   - Fixed `email` parameter indexing in `WebDatabase.runAsync` so subsequent fields (`planning_period`, `years_in_frs`, `notes`) are not shifted.\n   - Added safe fallbacks for `attempts_count` and `cadence_step` in `LeadsRepository.updateLeadDisposition` to prevent `NaN`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n- **React State Reference Equality in Web PWA:**\n  - `WebDatabase` holds in-memory references in `this.leads`. If `LeadsRepository.getLeadById` returns the raw internal object and `setLead(l)` is called, React sees `l === prevLead` and skips re-rendering.\n  - Always clone the object (`setLead({ ...l })`) and update state optimistically when toggling dispositions.\n- **Expo Web Bundling & Surge Deployment Pipeline:**\n  - Build command: `node node_modules/expo/bin/cli export -p web` (or `npx expo export -p web`).\n  - Post-build steps:\n    1. `Copy-Item -Path \"web\\manifest.json\" -Destination \"dist\\manifest.json\" -Force`\n    2. `Copy-Item -Path \"web\\sw.js\" -Destination \"dist\\sw.js\" -Force`\n    3. Inject PWA meta/title tags into `dist/index.html`.\n    4. `Copy-Item -Path \"dist\\index.html\" -Destination \"dist\\200.html\" -Force`\n    5. `npx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n- `src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx`: Header title wrapping fix (`numberOfLines={1}`, `flexShrink: 0`, compact icon gaps).\n- `src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`: Email editing/display, DNC/Reinstate dynamic toggle, optimistic updates, and toast notifications.\n- `src/db/database.ts`: Fixed parameter index mapping in `UPDATE leads` for `email` field.\n- `src/db/leadsRepository.ts`: Added fallback guards for `attempts_count` and `cadence_step`.\n- `src/services/calendarService.ts`: Added safe `Date` instance checks in `buildEducatorEvent`.\n- `src/services/csvService.ts`: Added safe date parsing `formatDateSafe`.\n\n### Viewed Files\n- `src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`: Lines 580–620 (header subtitle single-line guards).\n- `src/screens/PlanningHeatmapScreen.tsx`: Lines 70–110 (header title single-line guards).\n\n---\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n1. **Add High-Visibility DNC Banner Card in `src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`:**\n   - In `LeadDetailScreen.tsx`, inside `profileCard` right under `profileTop`, add a prominent alert banner when `isDNC` is true:\n     ```tsx\n     {isDNC ? (\n       <View style={styles.dncWarningBox}>\n         <ShieldAlert size={16} color=\"#EF4444\" />\n         <Text style={styles.dncWarningText}>\n           DO NOT CALL: Educator opted out. Removed from active dialing queues.\n         </Text>\n       </View>\n     ) : null}\n     ```\n2. **Build Web Bundle & Deploy to Surge:**\n   ```powershell\n   node node_modules/expo/bin/cli export -p web\n   Copy-Item -Path \"web\\manifest.json\" -Destination \"dist\\manifest.json\" -Force\n   Copy-Item -Path \"web\\sw.js\" -Destination \"dist\\sw.js\" -Force\n   $html = Get-Content \"dist\\index.html\" -Raw\n   $pwaTags = @\"\n       <title>SnapDialer - ValuTeachers Power Dialer</title>\n       <meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-speed field card scanner, power dialer, and FRS scheduling HUD for ValuTeachers.\" />\n       <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#051F14\" />\n       <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\" />\n       <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"black-translucent\" />\n       <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"SnapDialer\" />\n       <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\" />\n   \"@\n   $html = $html.Replace(\"<title>SnapDialer</title>\", $pwaTags)\n   Set-Content -Path \"dist\\index.html\" -Value $html -Encoding utf8\n   Copy-Item -Path \"dist\\index.html\" -Destination \"dist\\200.html\" -Force\n   npx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh\n   ```\n3. **Confirm with User:** Report that DNC visual banners and the emerald `🔄 Reinstate` button are verified and live on `https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`.\n\nYou have the 4 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1787239731075]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3/.user_uploaded/media_1787239731075.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-20T15:30:15Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1787239731084]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3/.user_uploaded/media_1787239731084.jpg\nLast Edited: 2026-08-20T15:30:15Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: implementation_plan]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3/implementation_plan.md\nLast Edited: 2026-08-23T21:22:30Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: walkthrough]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3/walkthrough.md\nLast Edited: 2026-08-23T21:54:31Z\n\n# Conversation Logs\n\nReference the following log files for the full, untruncated conversation:\n\n- C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\.system_generated\\logs\\transcript.jsonl\n\n**IMPORTANT: this summary is just for your reference. You may respond to my previous and future messages, but DO NOT ACKNOWLEDGE THIS CHECKPOINT MESSAGE. JUST READ IT BUT DO NOT MENTION IT, RESPOND TO IT, OR TAKE ACTION BECAUSE OF IT.**"}
